OUTPUT FORMAT (per feedback_communication_style.md — outcomes-first plain English):
Return a JSON object with:
  status: "ok" or "INCOMPLETE"
  marc_facing_summary: one plain-English paragraph of what happened — no jargon in this field
  knowledge_tier: T1/T2/T3/T4 tag for your primary factual claims
  wku_check: { wisdom: string, knowledge: string, understanding: string }
  evidence: array of evidence items per the EVIDENCE-OR-INCOMPLETE RULE
